# Coding Agent v0.1 run artifacts (evidence/audit) — local-only for now.
# Ignore the contents rather than the directory itself, so the negation below can
# take effect: git does not descend into an excluded directory.
.agent/*

# Agent-owned SDLC artifacts (frozen intent, spec, plan, work contract) are the
# durable versioned record of a work item, not scratch. They are tracked so each
# stage can commit its output with a plain `git add`.
!.agent/work/
